#!/bin/bash
# Wifi and Bluetooth off (mp-net-static.d/for/rpi-boot-firmware/config.txt.d)
# have to be in the config.txt the boot partition gets. Late, so after
# rpi-boot-firmware assembled it.

set -euo pipefail

cfg=${1:?root filesystem}/boot/firmware/config.txt
bad=0
for line in dtoverlay=disable-wifi dtoverlay=disable-bt; do
   grep -qxF -- "$line" "$cfg" || { echo "mp-net-static: config.txt lacks $line" >&2; bad=1; }
done
exit $bad
